{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51715","headline":"咏浑家乐（二首） 一 · 陈裕","name":"咏浑家乐（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨起梳头午不休，一窠精魅闹啾啾。\n阿家解舞《清平乐》，新妇能抛白木球。\n着绿桃牌吹觱篥，赐绯盟器和《梁州》。\n天明任你浑家乐，雨下还须满舍愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}